    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island of FEROS, where something is clearly wrong. In this 3rd person action adventure game you will search for the beacons to light bringing peace and restoration to this troubled land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding keys, moving boulders, figuring out how to access the areas where the beacons are. Sometimes you might even need to enter the Grim to manipulate the environment giving you access to previously unreachable locales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENTER THE GRIM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part of your journey will be having to enter the dark spiritual realm, known as the Grim. The world changes when you enter it, but be careful, danger lurks in the Grim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIGHT THE BEACONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To restore joy to the world, you will have to figure out how to light the beacons. Along the way, you will meet people to help and who will help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island of FEROS, where something is clearly wrong. In this 3rd person action adventure game you will search for the beacons to light bringing peace and restoration to this troubled land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding keys, moving boulders, figuring out how to access the areas where the beacons are. Sometimes you might even need to enter the Grim to manipulate the environment giving you access to previously unreachable locales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENTER THE GRIM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part of your journey will be having to enter the dark spiritual realm, known as the Grim. The world changes when you enter it, but be careful, danger lurks in the Grim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIGHT THE BEACONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To restore joy to the world, you will have to figure out how to light the beacons. Along the way, you will meet people to help and who will help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "An action-adventure game where you explore the island solving puzzles to light the lighthouses and bring light back to this troubled world. Enter the Grim to change the world, but be careful the Grim contains dark spiritual forces who want to make you as twisted as they are.",
